{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Tare: Kitchen Companion》是一款專為家庭煮食人士與專業廚師而設的烹飪計算工具，具備密度感知換算、智能食譜調整及精準廚房運算等核心功能。原價 US $2.99，現正限時免費，適合經常處理複雜菜式、烘焙或需要精準食材換算的用家。</p>\n\n<h2>智能食譜調整</h2>\n<p>《Tare: Kitchen Companion》內置超過 310 種經 USDA 與 King Arthur Baking 驗證密度的食材資料庫，支援克、盎司、毫升、杯、湯匙及茶匙等單位換算，亦提供智能食譜縮放、鹽類換算、烘焙百分比、對流烤箱調整及多計時器功能，全部可於離線環境使用，協助家庭煮食人士與專業廚師穩定完成複雜菜式。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/320x480bb.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/320x480bb-1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/320x480bb-2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/320x480bb-3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/320x480bb-4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/320x480bb-5.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Tare: Kitchen Companion</li>\n<li>應用類別：Food &amp; Drink</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T10:00:54.385063+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":359,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}